## Hardware / setup
- Controller: Raspberry Pi 4 now; ESP32 arriving ~2 weeks. Code layered so only
  the I²C read/write layer needs porting to ESP32.
- Pi has no built-in DAC/ADC → external MCP4728 (4-ch DAC) + ADS1115 (4-ch ADC),
  both I²C, shared bus.
- CRITICAL: Pi I²C is 3.3V, chips may be 5V → needs a logic level shifter
  (e.g. TXS0108E) or run everything at 3.3V. Don't skip — protects the Pi.

